{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A UNIQUE WORLD EVERY TIME YOU PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/f1c3f64babfdece4d1ca3bf2079b9d5c.poster.avif?t=1763286565\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/f1c3f64babfdece4d1ca3bf2079b9d5c.webm?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/f1c3f64babfdece4d1ca3bf2079b9d5c.mp4?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/56a8ae41518106d254508fa7fc863c45.webp?t=1763286565\" width=20 height=35 /></span>\u00a0<strong>limb through a massive, ever-shifting environment full of danger, enemies, and high-stakes swinging. Dodge collapsing ledges, shifting walls, hostile creatures, and unpredictable terrain as you climb toward the surface with your brother, tethered by a single tail. Make it to the top, and you\u2019ll earn more than just bragging rights \u2014 you\u2019ll escape one of the toughest climbs ever built.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAP , FAIL TRY AGAIN\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/f1aaaced121422de564543e3b40e8da6.poster.avif?t=1763286565\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/f1aaaced121422de564543e3b40e8da6.webm?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/f1aaaced121422de564543e3b40e8da6.mp4?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/52d34f92972a2bb0060818b269085f1b.webp?t=1763286565\" width=20 height=35 /></span>\u00a0wo monkeys, one tail that binds them. Every leap, every swing, every slip depends on working together. Coordinate your momentum, catch each other in midair, and fight to stay alive. In local co-op, chaos and teamwork collide as you climb toward freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/52d34f92972a2bb0060818b269085f1b.webp?t=1763286565\" width=20 height=35 /></span>\u00a0he environment is alive \u2014 twisting, shaking, spawning enemies, always against you. If you falter for a second, it wins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PURE PHYSICS, PURE CONTROL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/89ba7e57a7048f96d1c7e6584152ecb6.poster.avif?t=1763286565\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/89ba7e57a7048f96d1c7e6584152ecb6.webm?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/89ba7e57a7048f96d1c7e6584152ecb6.mp4?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/56a8ae41518106d254508fa7fc863c45.webp?t=1763286565\" width=20 height=35 /></span>\u00a0limb with full control \u2014 or fall trying. Every swing, grab, and jump is on you. There\u2019s no set path \u2014 just collapsing rock, hostile creatures, and shifting terrain daring you to keep climbing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SINGLE OR COOP SURVIVAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/8ac4a2e8903a2cebf66e04ac8d8a9717.webp?t=1763286565\" width=20 height=35 /></span>\u00a0astery won\u2019t save you. Every play changes.  Climb fast. Get out alive. This is pure climbing survival \u2014 no checkpoints, no training wheels, no second chances. Just you, your brother, your shared tail, and an environment that never stops trying to drag you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/1d1517d46be3b79452f350c95121e5cb.poster.avif?t=1763286565\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/1d1517d46be3b79452f350c95121e5cb.webm?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/1d1517d46be3b79452f350c95121e5cb.mp4?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/52d34f92972a2bb0060818b269085f1b.webp?t=1763286565\" width=20 height=35 /></span>\u00a0his game is all about the grind. You\u2019ll fall. A lot. But every mistake teaches you something. Some players take the careful route. Others risk everything with wild swings and shortcuts. However you climb, one thing\u2019s for sure \u2014 you\u2019ll earn every second you survive. You're dodging roots, weaving through jagged stone, slipping past hostile creatures, and squeezing through gaps that barely fit two monkeys bound by a tail. One swing too wide and you\u2019re toast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/0c620f1bae174134fcab46c59f38c1d2.poster.avif?t=1763286565\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/0c620f1bae174134fcab46c59f38c1d2.webm?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/0c620f1bae174134fcab46c59f38c1d2.mp4?t=1763286565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/extras/0ed76bdc071d6bd01504629d090df35e.avif?t=1763286565\" width=616 height=80 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cStore page is localized for easier browsing. The game itself is currently available in English only.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946390?t=1763286565","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/c3230de98a8fd8640d6f8b50f6f294d82b6cdaad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763286565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946390/97b8f23b22276892119fc40ecb23a7f1b9916e3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763286565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.st